WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:07,410
Everyone put down their guns. Offended.

2
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,370
It was the person from the crew who reported it, right?

3
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:12,090
It was reported by Zhang Ming

4
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:16,230
Got it. Thank you for your hard work. Come back and collect the team.

5
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:20,640
Master, what happened? Someone reported me.

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,160
Then why are you saluting?

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,600
They realized they had arrested the wrong person

8
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,360
Zheng Zhuhui, who is he?

9
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:28,160
The chief executive of the special unit meets him

10
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,800
It scared me to death that he took his orders first at the scene.

11
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:32,280
Fortunately, there are civil servants

12
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:36,100
That's him, right?

13
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,900
Zhang Ming resigned immediately

14
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,180
Stop cooperation within the industry

15
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:40,740
Reporting firearms is correct

16
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,060
But insulting behind the back

17
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,420
It's also his own choice

18
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,080
You are a civil servant

19
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:49,220
No wonder Su Linyun spreads rumors about you everywhere

20
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,660
He is afraid that you will threaten him

21
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:57,230
Make friends. My name is Shenyang. I almost forgot.

22
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,550
I still have to go to the Su family to speak on my behalf.
